WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Scene one: the stand-by message.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.400
Radio: (the stand-by code word - a short tone)

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.300
Narrator: Faisal goes straight to his gate, checks it, and waits - calm, and saying nothing to fans.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Fan: What's happening?

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.000
Faisal: Just a routine check. If we need you to move, we'll tell you.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Radio: All marshals at C gates, open exit gates now.

7
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.900
Narrator: Then the instruction comes to open exit gates.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:36.100
Narrator: He opens it fully, secures it, stands to the side - and politely stops a fan coming in.

9
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.600
Faisal: Sorry, this gate is exit only now.

